summary:
  The footer stops asking whether the retry ladder is waiting, so a station
  being tried again reads "Choose station and enjoy…".

history:
  The decision is tested in RetryLogic; FullRepresentation.qml has no tests
  of its own, so whether the footer still asks is held by an invariant.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                      else if (RetryLogic.betweenKnocks(root._wantsPlaying, root._healRetryAttempts))

replace:
                      else if (false)

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_the_footer_says_reconnecting_while_the_ladder_waits.
  Line-neutral.
